{"from":"4:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"2TI.4.1\">1</ref> He exhorts him to do his duty with all care and diligence;<br/><ref to=\"2TI.4.6\">6</ref> certifies him of the nearness of his death;<br/><ref to=\"2TI.4.9\">9</ref> wills him to come speedily unto him, and to bring Marcus with him, and certain things which he wrote for;<br/><ref to=\"2TI.4.14\">14</ref> warns him to beware of Alexander the smith.<br/><ref to=\"2TI.4.16\">16</ref> informs him what had befallen him at his first answering;<br/><ref to=\"2TI.4.19\">19</ref> and soon after he concludes.<br/><br/><br/>charge.<br/><ref to=\"2TI.2.14 1TI.5.21 1TI.6.13\">2:14; 1Ti 5:21; 6:13</ref><br/>who.<br/><ref to=\"PSA.50.6 PSA.96.13 PSA.98.9 MAT.16.27 MAT.25.31-MAT.25.46 JHN.5.22-JHN.5.27 ACT.10.42\">Ps 50:6; 96:13; 98:9; Mt 16:27; 25:31-46; Joh 5:22-27; Ac 10:42</ref><br/><ref to=\"ACT.17.31 ROM.2.16 ROM.14.9-ROM.14.11 1CO.4.4 1CO.4.5 2CO.5.9 2CO.5.10 2TH.1.7-2TH.1.10\">Ac 17:31; Ro 2:16; 14:9-11; 1Co 4:4,5; 2Co 5:9,10; 2Th 1:7-10</ref><br/><ref to=\"1PE.4.5 REV.20.11-REV.20.15\">1Pe 4:5; Re 20:11-15</ref><br/>at.<br/><ref to=\"2TI.4.8 COL.3.4 1TH.4.15 1TH.4.16 1TI.6.14 TIT.2.13 HEB.9.27 HEB.9.28 1PE.1.7\">8; Col 3:4; 1Th 4:15,16; 1Ti 6:14; Tit 2:13; Heb 9:27,28; 1Pe 1:7</ref><br/><ref to=\"1PE.5.4 1JN.2.28 REV.1.7\">1Pe 5:4; 1Jo 2:28; Re 1:7</ref><br/>his kingdom.<br/><ref to=\"LUK.19.12 LUK.19.15 LUK.23.42 2PE.1.11 2PE.1.17\">Lu 19:12,15; 23:42; 2Pe 1:11,17</ref></p>"}
